You are generating UI for Sales Tracker module bundles. The result MUST look identical to the core Vue 3 + Tailwind frontend. Do not invent a new visual language. Copy this design system exactly.

STACK
- Vue 3 + TypeScript + <script setup>
- Tailwind CSS (utility-first). Almost no custom CSS.
- Heroicons-style outline icons (24x24, stroke currentColor, stroke-width 2, rounded caps/joins)
- Polish UI copy
- Reuse existing component class names: btn, btn-primary, btn-secondary, btn-danger, btn-sm, btn-lg, input, label, card, badge, badge-primary, badge-success, badge-warning, badge-danger, table

BODY / THEME
- Dark-only app. No light theme.
- html/body: bg-dark-900, text-dark-100, antialiased
- Font: system/default. Do not add Google Fonts.
- Language: pl

COLOR TOKENS (exact hex, Tailwind extend)

primary (blue accent):
50 #eff6ff
100 #dbeafe
200 #bfdbfe
300 #93c5fd
400 #60a5fa
500 #3b82f6
600 #2563eb   ← main CTA / logo tile / avatar
700 #1d4ed8
800 #1e40af
900 #1e3a8a
950 #172554

dark (slate surfaces):
50 #f8fafc
100 #f1f5f9
200 #e2e8f0
300 #cbd5e1   ← labels
400 #94a3b8   ← muted text, icons, table headers, placeholders
500 #64748b   ← italic empty states
600 #475569   ← borders on inputs, hover rows
700 #334155   ← sidebar hover, borders, pulse skeletons
800 #1e293b   ← sidebar, header, cards
900 #0f172a   ← page background
950 #020617

Semantic:
- success: green-400 on green-600/20
- warning: yellow-400 on yellow-600/20
- danger: red-400 on red-600/20, danger buttons bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700
- info/links: primary-400, hover:underline
- orange (priority high): orange-400 on orange-600/20
- purple used only for some dashboard stat icons: purple-400 on purple-600/20

COMPONENT CLASSES (copy exactly)

.btn
inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors
focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-dark-900

.btn-primary  bg-primary-600 text-white hover:bg-primary-700 focus:ring-primary-500
.btn-secondary  bg-dark-700 text-dark-100 hover:bg-dark-600 focus:ring-dark-500
.btn-danger  bg-red-600 text-white hover:bg-red-700 focus:ring-red-500
.btn-sm  px-3 py-1.5 text-sm
.btn-lg  px-6 py-3 text-lg
disabled buttons: opacity-50 / opacity-70 + cursor-wait when loading

.input
w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-dark-800 border border-dark-600
text-dark-100 placeholder-dark-400
focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent
transition-colors
(used for input, select, textarea)

.label
block text-sm font-medium text-dark-300 mb-1
required asterisk: <span class="text-red-400">*</span>

.card
bg-dark-800 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 p-6
list tables: extra classes "card p-0 overflow-hidden"

.badge
inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium
.badge-primary  bg-primary-600/20 text-primary-400
.badge-success  bg-green-600/20 text-green-400
.badge-warning  bg-yellow-600/20 text-yellow-400
.badge-danger   bg-red-600/20 text-red-400
compact badge: text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5

.table  w-full text-left
.table th  px-4 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-dark-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-dark-800/50
.table td  px-4 py-3 text-sm text-dark-200 border-t border-dark-700
.table tr:hover td  bg-dark-800/30

APP SHELL (core already owns this; module views render ONLY inside <main class="p-6">)
- Page: min-h-screen bg-dark-900
- Sidebar: fixed left, h-screen, bg-dark-800, border-r border-dark-700, z-40
  expanded w-64, collapsed w-20
  logo bar h-16, px-4, border-b border-dark-700
  logo mark: w-10 h-10 bg-primary-600 rounded-lg, white icon
  app name: text-lg font-semibold text-white
  nav item: flex gap-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-dark-300 hover:bg-dark-700 hover:text-white
  active: bg-dark-700 text-white
  icons w-5 h-5
  submenu: ml-8, text-sm text-dark-400, child icons w-4 h-4
  bottom settings separated by border-t border-dark-700
- Header: h-16 bg-dark-800 border-b border-dark-700 px-6
  title: text-lg font-medium text-white
  icon buttons: p-2 rounded-lg text-dark-400 hover:bg-dark-700 hover:text-white
  user avatar: w-8 h-8 bg-primary-600 rounded-full text-white text-sm font-medium
- Main content padding is already p-6. Module views start with space-y-6.

PAGE PATTERNS

1) LIST PAGE
Outer: <div class="space-y-6">
Toolbar: flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between
Title: text-xl font-semibold text-white  (or omit if header already has it)
Primary action: <a/button class="btn btn-primary"> PlusIcon w-4 h-4 mr-2 + label
Secondary view switches: btn btn-secondary btn-sm with icon mr-1
Filters: SearchField full width, optional select class="input w-40"
Table in card p-0 overflow-hidden
Empty: td colspan, text-center py-8 text-dark-400
Loading: LoadingDots in cell, text-dark-400, animated dots
Row entity: avatar circle + name as text-primary-400 hover:underline
Row actions: p-1.5 rounded hover:bg-dark-600 text-dark-400 hover:text-white; delete hover:text-red-400
Pagination footer: flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-t border-dark-700
  left: text-sm text-dark-400 "X–Y z Z"
  right: two btn btn-secondary btn-sm chevrons
Default page size: 20

Avatars:
- contacts: bg-green-600 rounded-full
- employees: typically primary/green circle with initials
- header user: bg-primary-600
Initials: first+last letter uppercase, one word → first letter, empty → ?

2) FORM PAGE
Outer: max-w-2xl (or flex + sticky AI panel on the right)
H1: text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-6
Form: class="card space-y-6"
Field groups: single column; related fields grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 or md:grid-cols-3 gap-4
Repeating rows: flex items-center gap-2; add = btn btn-secondary btn-sm; remove = p-2 rounded bg-dark-700 text-dark-400 hover:text-red-400 disabled:opacity-50
Footer: flex justify-end gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-dark-700
  Anuluj = btn btn-secondary
  Submit = btn btn-primary, disabled while saving, text "Zapisywanie..." / "Zapisz zmiany" / "Utwórz …"
Loading skeleton: card with several h-16 bg-dark-700 rounded animate-pulse
Textarea: class="input" rows="4" or min-h-[5rem]

3) DETAIL PAGE
Outer: space-y-6
Header row: flex items-start justify-between
Left: avatar w-16 h-16 + h1 text-2xl font-semibold text-white + subtitle text-dark-400
Right: Edytuj btn btn-secondary (PencilIcon mr-2), Usuń btn btn-danger (TrashIcon mr-2)
Body: grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 of cards
Card title: text-lg font-medium or font-semibold text-white mb-4, optional muted icon w-5 h-5 text-dark-400
List rows inside card: p-2 rounded bg-dark-700/50
Empty: text-dark-500 italic
Definition lists: dt text-sm text-dark-400, dd text-dark-200, grid gap-4

4) SETTINGS / MODULE CARDS
card, h2 text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-4
description text-sm text-dark-400
links text-sm text-primary-400 hover:text-primary-300
module tiles: p-4 rounded-lg border
  enabled: bg-dark-700/50 border-dark-600
  disabled: bg-dark-800/50 border-dark-700 opacity-60
icon tile w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-600/20 text-primary-400 (or bg-dark-600 text-dark-400 if off)
grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4

5) DASHBOARD STATS
grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4
each: card flex items-center gap-4
icon box w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-{color}-600/20, icon w-6 h-6 text-{color}-400
label text-sm text-dark-400
value text-2xl font-semibold text-white

6) MODAL
overlay: fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/60 flex items-center justify-center p-4
panel: card w-full max-w-2xl max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto space-y-4
title text-lg font-semibold text-white
subtitle text-sm text-dark-400 mt-1
close: btn btn-secondary btn-sm with XMarkIcon

7) DROPDOWN MENU
absolute z-20 mt-2 min-w-[12rem] rounded-lg border border-dark-600 bg-dark-800 py-1 shadow-xl
section label: px-3 py-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-dark-400
item: flex w-full items-center px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm text-dark-200 hover:bg-dark-700 hover:text-white
divider: my-1 border-t border-dark-700

8) TOASTS (core owns them; match if you emit UI)
fixed bottom-4 right-4 z-50 flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-lg
item: flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border backdrop-blur-sm
success: bg-green-600/10 border-green-600/30 text-green-400
error: bg-red-600/10 border-red-600/30 text-red-400
warning: bg-yellow-600/10 border-yellow-600/30 text-yellow-400
info: bg-primary-600/10 border-primary-600/30 text-primary-400
title font-medium text-white, message text-sm opacity-80
slide in from right 0.3s

9) SEARCH FIELD
relative wrapper
left icon absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-10 text-dark-400 MagnifyingGlassIcon h-4 w-4
input: input w-full pl-10 pr-10 type=search, hide native search decorations
clear button right w-10 text-dark-400 hover:text-white
debounce ~300ms

10) SIDE PANEL (e.g. AI)
card flex flex-col h-[32rem] lg:h-[calc(100vh-8rem)] lg:w-96 lg:sticky lg:top-6
header pb-4 border-b border-dark-700

SPACING / RADIUS / MOTION
- Page vertical rhythm: space-y-6
- Form fields: space-y-6, inner lists space-y-2
- Gaps: gap-2, gap-3, gap-4, gap-6
- Radius: buttons/inputs/nav rounded-lg; cards rounded-xl; badges/avatars rounded-full
- Transitions: transition-colors; layout width transition-all duration-300
- No drop shadows on cards. Shadow only on dropdowns (shadow-xl).
- Focus rings: ring-2 ring-primary-500 on inputs; buttons also ring-offset-2 ring-offset-dark-900
- Do not use rounded-none, huge shadows, gradients, glassmorphism (except toast backdrop-blur-sm), neon, or light cards.

ICON RULES
- Outline Heroicons, class w-4 h-4 in buttons, w-5 h-5 in nav/headers, w-6 h-6 in stats
- Icon in primary/secondary buttons sits before label with mr-2 (sm buttons mr-1)
- Do not use emoji as icons

COPY / UX CONVENTIONS
- List create CTA: "Nowy …" / "Dodaj …"
- Form cancel: "Anuluj"
- Save: "Zapisz zmiany" vs create: "Utwórz …"
- Delete confirm via window.confirm or modal; danger button
- Empty lists: "Brak … do wyświetlenia" / "Brak … dla frazy „{search}”"
- Notifications titles: "Sukces" / "Błąd"
- Loading text: "Ładowanie…" or "Loading" + animated dots
- Links inside dark UI: text-primary-400 hover:underline

DO NOT
- Do not restyle the shell (sidebar/header) inside a module bundle unless asked
- Do not introduce new color palettes, Inter/Roboto, or light backgrounds
- Do not use arbitrary one-off CSS when a utility or .btn/.input/.card exists
- Do not make cards white, navy-blue, or Material/Bootstrap looking
- Match existing core screens pixel-for-pixel in density: compact tables, 16px header, 24px page padding

When building a screen, pick one of the page patterns above and compose only from these tokens and classes.